Fetched 2026-11-17 from the master branch, src/nanosvg.h.
Upstream commit: 239e102ec2c691f2902e20ace2ed36ee4a35cfe6 (2026-07-09)

Altered source version (zlib clause 2). The only changes, each marked
"NLASER PATCH" in nanosvg.h:
  * NSVGshape and NSVGattrib gain `groupId`: the inkscape:label, else the id,
    of the innermost enclosing <g> (ids that are only a generated "g123" are
    ignored). Upstream keeps only the shape's own id, so a shape with an id
    loses the layer it sits in, and Nlaser maps SVG groups to layers.
  * nsvg__nameGroup(), called when a <g> starts, fills it.

Used from exactly one translation unit, src/laser/svg_nanosvg.cpp, which
hides it behind src/laser/svg_raw.hpp. No Nlaser header includes it.
